Node ID=21 the horde price
Text=Si. I sell to you. I sell to everyone, amigo, that is the business. But last spring your Khan's boys came through this crossroads and took what they liked off three of my carts and left me the axles, and somebody has to pay for the carts. So it is my price, and then it is your price, and they are not the same price. There is another merchant four days south if you do not care for mine.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
